==== Network interfaces ====
The default network configuration is:
^ Interface Name   ^ Description               ^ Default configuration    ^
| br-lan           | LAN & WiFi                | 192.168.1.1/24   |
| wlan0            | WiFi 802.11bgn (2.4 GHz)  | Disabled         |
| wlan1            | WiFi  802.11nac (5 GHz)   | Disabled         |



==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====
This Access Point has no hardware switch builtin.

==== Buttons ====
-> [[docs:guide-user:hardware:hardware.button]] on howto use and configure the hardware button(s).
Here, we merely name the buttons, so we can use them in the above Howto.

The D-Link DAP-2610 has the following buttons:

^ BUTTON                       ^ Event   ^
| Reset                |  reset  |

Press Reset button shorter than 1 second: perform a reboot.

Press Reset button more than 5 seconds: perform a factory reset.


